# Majors that cannot be taken, accepted with reasoning: an npm major that
# cannot install beside its manifest, or a NuGet major that ships no
# framework the referencing project can consume. scripts/check-held-majors.sh
# reads this for both ecosystems; the format is
#
#   <directory> <package> <reason>
#
# where <directory> is the manifest's directory as .github/dependabot.yml
# names it (`/` is `.`; the NuGet one is where Directory.Packages.props is).
# An entry is a debt: the check fails once the bump installs or there is no
# newer major left, so nothing here outlives its reason. Empty today.
